WEBVTT - typo3-rector (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.800
TYPO3 12 code calls APIs that version 14 removed.

2
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.927
You ask for the deprecated PHP calls to be fixed.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.849
The dry run lists 13 files and the rule for each change. Fractor tidies two label files.

4
00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:35.317
Apply, dry-run again: one generated file left. Once more: Rector is done.

5
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:41.761
One applied pass is not completion. The clean dry run is.

6
00:00:43.361 --> 00:00:46.299
Open source. Clone the skills.
